// FROM. Checked in deliberately (DESIGN.md rule 2): the engine parses no
// JSON and has no dependencies. The `#[cfg(test)] mod
// baked_table_matches_source_data` at the bottom of this file replaces the
// generator's own guarantee: it re-derives every card from `data/*.json` at
// TEST time and asserts the result equals what is baked here, so a hand-edit
// to either side that drifts from the other fails the build instead of
// silently disagreeing.

